              │                                                                     ││
              │Getting started                                                      ││
              │───────────────                                                      ││
              │• Open the menus with F10, or click a menu name. Arrow keys move,    ││
              │Enter runs, Esc backs out. Each menu has an Alt shortcut too (Alt+F  ││
              │for File).                                                           ││
              │• Open a file with Ctrl+O, save with Ctrl+S, and close a tab with    ││
              │Ctrl+W.                                                              ││──────────────
